{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odessa features inventive characters, great dialogues and one of Indinera's best, most intriguing storylines - with a lot of thrilling twists and turns that will keep you thinking and guessing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retired bodyguard has to team up with a smart down-to-earth bunny-girl, an elegant but tight-lipped beggar and a stray dog to keep the hope of rescuing his soon-to-be wife, spectacularly abducted by mysterious, spine-chilling individuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, a secretive cult around a strange goddess (the Goddess of Ashes) is developing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How could the two things be related? And will he be able to see his beloved one again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this exciting 2D RPG featuring both investigation and classic exploration, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hours of playtime, 13 Relics, 8 Mystery Areas and 7 Animals to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave after each battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to customize your experience including Adjustable Battle Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Modes of Difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells and skills you can master, to create even stronger &quot;super&quot; technics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +/++</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enthralling plot full of twists and turns that will keep you guessing constantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great dialogues featuring unique and well-developed characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic cut scenes to display better the intense plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous weather effects for a more immersive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams! Nightmares! Like in Laxius Force and Soul!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indinera's signature and vintage style for gameplay and story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"KIDNAPPED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/82ff978b5bba174ea7b0ddb7c164d43b12a0f685.jpg"},{"name":"ODESSA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/a01c82dee2fd3ccf63bc33a32e14db5ba9fba707.jpg"},{"name":"FINALLY SAFE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/3593430eb4672d74c0399098ba56b64316cfb87c.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/11278cf32c773828b6437057b5880ca406633aa0.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/753e477a47d3e66c789c9a554f545f63d7edce3f.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/c467c978fe908dfab2d73685ed9c5fb13c285e23.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/95312cfa01b7d01812911bd2631450bd7283bdc0.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/5676934803a9ea2e222dc87d93ed0e147720465c.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318360/f307980b41b17de20d6117f59a5b71f367dbb060.jpg"},{"name":"MYSTERY ROOM 7","path":"https://c